          "question": "e-13138",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the following sets:\n\n$$\n\\mathbb N, \\quad \\mathbb Z, \\quad \\mathbb Q, \\quad \\mathbb R, \\quad \\mathbb C\n$$\n\nTo which of these sets does the number $3.25$ belong?",
