          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "To which of the following sets do all the negative integers belong? \n\n- $\\mathbb{Z}$\n\n- $\\mathbb{Z}_0^+$\n\n- $\\mathbb{Q}^-$\n\n- $\\mathbb{R}_0^-$",
